            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Average of three small hydropower plants. As parts of the infrastructure are already existing, the model is limited to the integration of material and energy. It basically consists of the integration of the turbine and generator into the existing constructions. The lifetime is assumed to be around 80 years. The data set describes a mix and is therefore not representative for individual plants. Sources: Baumgartner &amp; Doka (1998), Konersmann &amp; Jean-Baptiste (2000).;
