            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average small hydropower plant integrated in existing infrastructure (e.g. drinking water supply, irrigation system). Capacity of 0.19MW\n\n# Included processes\nThe dataset describes the construction of an average small hydropower plant integrated in an already existing waterworks infrastructure such as e.g. drinking water supply or irrigation system. It includes the materials used, the electricity and diesel consumed as well as the transports needed.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
